      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we actually ask for the number of items in the VFS or Now Playing scopes.\n\nIIRC, the number of items currently in scope in the browsed player arrives as part of the SetBrowsedPlayer response, so we just use that there to get an idea of how many items to expect. For other folders, I don\u0027t think we actually ask for the number of items at all, so we don\u0027t know large to expect the folder to be.\n\nEither way, when we download, we ask for contents 20 items at a time until we receive an out of bounds error response. In that way, we\u0027re agnostic of the number of items actually in a folder. I think we also cap it to 255 items.",
